cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the paper and the MS3SEG dataset."
title: "Region-Decoupled Distillation for CPU-Deployable MS Lesion Segmentation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a knowledge-distillation study transferring a
  full-resolution Mix Transformer teacher into a 0.49M-parameter U-Net for
  four-class multiple sclerosis lesion segmentation on the MS3SEG cohort,
  including a controlled eight-variant ablation of distillation objectives under
  extreme class imbalance.
type: software
license: MIT
